omplete 核心实现\n\n### 1. **tools.py 中的函数定义** (L35-45)\n```python\ndef task_complete(success: bool, summary: str) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"LLM 主动声明任务结束（fix/audit 循环识别 sentinel 后退出）。\n    success=True  → 任务完成；success=False → 主动放弃（\"我做不了\"）。\n    summary 用一句话说清楚做了什么/为什么放弃。\n    沉默退出（这一轮不调任何工具）= 默认 success=True。\n    \"\"\"\n    return {\n        \"_task_complete\": True,\n        \"success\": bool(success),\n        \"summary\": str(summary or \"\"),\n    }\n```\n- 返回 dict，包含 `_task_complete=True` sentinel 标记 + `success` 布尔值 + `summary` 字符串\n- 设计目的：LLM 显式声明任务终止点（防止沉默退出浪费 token）\n\n### 2. **tools_schema.py 工具注册** (L405-416)\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"task_complete\",\n  \"description\": \"显式声明本次任务结束。**每次任务都必须以此工具收尾**（fix/audit loop 识别后退出）。完成时 task_complete(success=true, summary='做了什么')；确认无法继续时 task_complete(success=false, summary='为什么放弃')。不要沉默退出——没调任何工具时 loop 会再追问一次浪费一轮。\",\n  \"parameters\": {\n    \"success\": {\"type\": \"boolean\", \"description\": \"true=任务完成；false=主动放弃\"},\n    \"summary\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"一句话说明做了什么或为什么放弃\"}\n  }\n}\n```\n- 加入 `READONLY_TOOL_NAMES` 白名单（L456），允许 audit/plan/explorer 子 agent 调用\n- 在 TOOLS 列表最后（L405）\n\n### 3. **agent.py 中的检测与处理** (L1160-1164)\n```python\n# task_complete: sentinel 退出信号；fix()/audit() 检测后跳出循环\nif name == \"task_complete\":\n    result = task_complete(**args)\n    return {\"name\": name, \"args\": args, \"id\": tool_call.id, \"result\": result}\n```\n- 在 `_dispatch_tool_call()` 函数的最前面检测（L1161-1162）\n- 直接调 tools.task_complete() 并返回 result dict\n\n## 三大关键使用流程\n\n### A. **fix() 循环** (agent.py L2253-2370)\n```python\ndef fix(test_result, plan, reason=\"test_failure\"):\n    # 根据测试错误或审查意见修复代码（多轮工具调用）\n    # 返回 dict: {\"early_exit\": bool, \"success\": bool, \"summary\": str}\n    \n    while rounds_used < _FIX_SOFT_LIMIT:\n        rounds_used += 1\n        response = call_llm(messages, tools=TOOLS, tool_choice=\"auto\")\n        \n        if response_message.tool_calls:\n            outs = _dispatch_tool_calls(response_message.tool_calls, ...)\n            for out in outs:\n                # ⭐ P0 #3 sentinel 检测\n                if out[\"result\"].get(\"_task_complete\"):\n                    success = bool(out[\"result\"].get(\"success\"))\n                    summary = out[\"result\"].get(\"summary\", \"\")\n                    return {\"early_exit\": True, \"success\": success, \"summary\": summary}\n        else:\n            # 沉默退出处理：第一次 → 追问一次；第二次 → 视为 early_exit=False\n            if not silent_prompted:\n                silent_prompted = True\n                messages.append({\n                    \"role\": \"system\",\n                    \"content\": \"You did not call any tool this turn — by protocol you must terminate explicitly with task_complete(success, summary)...\"\n                })\n                continue\n            return {\"early_exit\": False, \"success\": False, \"summary\": \"\"}\n    \n    # 软上限耗尽仍未 task_complete\n    return {\"early_exit\": False, \"success\": False, \"summary\": \"\"}\n```\n- **关键点**：成功调用 task_complete 时立即返回 `early_exit=True`，外层 run() 据此决定是否继续或标失败\n- 沉默退出二阶检测（L2347-2352）：第一次没工具 → 追问；第二次仍没工具 → 放弃\n\n### B. **code() 文件生成循环** (agent.py L1662-1800)\n```python\ndef code(plan, mode=\"auto\", requirement=\"\"):\n    # 多文件循环，每个文件 5 轮工具调用尝试\n    \n    for file_entry in files:\n        while attempts_left > 0:\n            response = call_llm(msgs, tools=TOOLS, tool_choice=tc)\n            if response_message.tool_calls:\n                outs = _dispatch_tool_calls(response_message.tool_calls, ...)\n                for out in outs:\n                    # ⭐ Coder 主动声明任务结束\n                    if out[\"result\"].get(\"_task_complete\"):\n                        _success = bool(out[\"result\"].get(\"success\"))\n                        _summary = out[\"result\"].get(\"summary\", \"\")\n                        if not _success:\n                            # 失败立即返回，不继续其他文件\n                            return {\"early_exit\": True, \"success\": False, \"summary\": _summary}\n                        # success=True：本文件完成，跳出 inner loop（多文件循环继续）\n                        coder_signal = {\"early_exit\": True, \"success\": True, \"summary\": _summary}\n                        _early_exit_inner = True\n                        break\n                if _early_exit_inner:\n                    break\n            else:\n                break  # 沉默退出当前文件\n    \n    return coder_signal  # None（正常完成）或 dict（early_exit signal）\n```\n- **关键区别**：Coder 的 task_complete 只影响单个文件，success=True 继续下一文件，success=False 才全局退出\n\n### C. **audit() 审计循环** (agent.py L1807-1954)\n```python\ndef audit(requirement):\n    # 只读多轮工具调用，最终输出 markdown 报告\n    \n    while rounds_used < _AUDIT_SOFT_LIMIT:\n        rounds_used += 1\n        response = call_llm(messages, tools=audit_tools, tool_choice=\"auto\")\n        \n        if msg.tool_calls:\n            outs = _dispatch_tool_calls(msg.tool_calls, mode=\"audit\", ...)\n            for out in outs:\n                # ⭐ P0 #3 sentinel 检测\n                if out[\"result\"].get(\"_task_complete\"):\n                    success = bool(out[\"result\"].get(\"success\"))\n                    summary = out[\"result\"].get(\"summary\", \"\")\n                    return {\n                        \"success\": success,\n                        \"report\": last_text or summary,\n                        \"task_complete_signal\": {\"early_exit\": True, \"success\": success, \"summary\": summary}\n                    }\n        else:\n            # 沉默退出处理同 fix()\n            if not silent_prompted:\n                silent_prompted = True\n                # 追问一次\n                continue\n            return {\"success\": True, \"report\": last_text}\n    \n    # 软上限耗尽\n    return {\"success\": bool(last_text), \"report\": last_text}\n```\n\n## subagent.py 中的子 agent 使用** (L150-270)\n\n### 子 agent 禁止递归\n```python\ndef _run_subagent(task: str, role: str = \"explorer\", max_steps: int = 8) -> dict:\n    if _is_in_subagent():\n        return {\n            \"success\": False,\n            \"summary\": \"子 agent 不能再派子 agent（递归被禁用）。请在父 agent 直接做。\",\n            \"steps\": 0, \"role\": role\n        }\n    \n    _set_in_subagent(True)  # thread-local flag\n    try:\n        while steps < max_steps_clamped:\n            response = call_llm(messages, tools=tools_subset, ...)\n            \n            if msg.tool_calls:\n                outs = _dispatch_tool_calls(msg.tool_calls, mode=dispatch_mode, ...)\n                done = False\n                for out in outs:\n                    # ⭐ 子 agent 的 task_complete 检测\n                    if out[\"name\"] == \"task_complete\":\n                        success = bool(out[\"result\"].get(\"success\"))\n                        summary = str(out[\"result\"].get(\"summary\") or \"\")\n                        done = True\n                if done:\n                    break\n            else:\n                # 沉默退出二阶\n                if not silent_prompted:\n                    silent_prompted = True\n                    messages.append({\n                        \"role\": \"system\",\n                        \"content\": \"你这一轮没调任何工具也没输出文本。请用 task_complete(success, summary) 收尾。\"\n                    })\n                    continue\n                if msg.content and not summary:\n                    summary = msg.content\n                break\n    finally:\n        _set_in_subagent(False)\n    \n    if not summary:\n        summary = \"（子 agent 未声明 task_complete，已截断）\"\n    \n    # P4-4：general 角色改了文件 → 在 summary 末尾追加修改清单\n    if role == \"general\" and files_modified_locally:\n        summary += f\"\\n\\n[系统提示] 此子任务修改了文件: {', '.join(files_modified_locally)}...\"\n    \n    return {\"success\": success, \"summary\": summary, \"steps\": steps, \"role\": role}\n```\n\n### 子 agent 工具集限制 (L118-130)\n```python\ndef _subagent_tools_for_role(role: str) -> list:\n    blocked = {\"dispatch_subagent\", \"update_plan_draft\", \"exit_plan_mode_signal\"}\n    if role in (\"explorer\", \"auditor\"):\n        allowed = (READONLY_TOOL_NAMES - blocked)  # 只读\n    elif role == \"general\":\n        allowed = (all_names - blocked)  # 除递归外全工具\n    return _filter_tools(allowed)\n```\n\n## main.py 中的结果处理** (L244-250)\n\n```python\ndef handle_task_result(result):\n    if result[\"success\"]:\n        console.print(\"\\n[bold green]任务完成！[/bold green]\")\n    else:\n        console.print(\"\\n[bold red]任务失败[/bold red]\")\n```\n\n## run() 主流程集成** (agent.py L2515-2680)\n\n```python\ndef run(requirement, mode=\"auto\"):\n    # [code 阶段]\n    coder_signal = code(plan, mode=mode, requirement=requirement)  # 返回 None 或 early_exit signal\n    \n    if coder_signal and coder_signal.get(\"success\"):\n        # Coder 主动声明完成 → 跳过测试直接返回\n        return report(True, test_result, task_complete_signal=coder_signal)\n    \n    if coder_signal and coder_signal.get(\"early_exit\"):\n        # Coder 主动放弃 → 全局失败\n        return report(False, test_result, task_complete_signal=coder_signal)\n    \n    # [测试阶段]\n    test_result = test(test_command)\n    \n    # [修复循环]\n    while attempts < max_attempts:\n        fix_signal = fix(test_result, plan_result)  # 返回 early_exit=bool\n        \n        if fix_signal.get(\"early_exit\"):\n            if fix_signal.get(\"success\"):\n                # LLM 主动声明完成 → 成功\n                return report(True, test_result, task_complete_signal=fix_signal)\n            else:\n                # LLM 主动放弃 → 失败\n                return report(False, test_result, task_complete_signal=fix_signal)\n        \n        # early_exit=False 意味继续 retry\n```\n\n## 关键设计模式总结\n\n1. **Sentinel 模式**：`_task_complete=True` 标记，loop 据此立即识别并退出\n2. **显式终止协议**：禁止沉默退出；第一次没工具 → 二阶追问；再没工具 → 强制退出\n3. **Role-based 工具集**：explorer/auditor 只读，general 全工具，dispatch_subagent 跨角色禁用\n4. **软上限 + 预算管理**：_FIX_SOFT_LIMIT=8, _AUDIT_SOFT_LIMIT=20，超预算时向 LLM 注入系统提示\n5. **多文件生成时机**：code() 的 task_complete 只控制单文件，success=True 继续，success=False 全局停止\n6.